      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I noticed the latest beta 1833 mentioned fixing crashes on build-and-test so I figured I should test again.\n\nHowever I'm still getting some crashes in build-and-test. I've uploaded more dumps to the google drive folder. Could just be coincidence bit it feel like it's more stable than before, I haven't caught any crashes in the middle anymore, only on join and on leave.",
